WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Turnforge: a scripted replay of one complete C++ tactical match.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
A wall click is rejected. Movement and attack actions remain available.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Preview a reachable BFS route, then move three tiles.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
The goblin pursues; the bandit approaches from another side.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
The next enemy turn is forecast to remove 2 HP.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Guard changes the forecast to 1 HP.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
The enemy hit removes 1 HP. Guard expires at the next player turn.

00:30.000 --> 00:39.000
Attack the bandit, then let the enemies resolve their turns.

00:39.000 --> 00:48.000
Finish the injured bandit. Its tile becomes free.

00:48.000 --> 00:57.000
Focus the remaining attacks on the goblin.

00:57.000 --> 01:06.000
Victory in round 6 with 3 HP remaining.
